MioHyphen
Copyright 2026 Readmio

This product includes software developed at Readmio.

The hyphenation algorithm is a pure-Kotlin reimplementation of Liang's TeX
hyphenation algorithm, based on the "pyphen" reference implementation.

This product bundles hyphenation pattern dictionaries (`hyph_*.dic`) from the
LibreOffice dictionaries project. Their licenses differ per language - BSD-style,
LGPL, LPPL, MPL and GPL all appear across the bundled set. Each language ships its
own `README_hyph_*.txt` with per-language credits and licensing; the full per-language
table is in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md. Review it before redistributing.
